          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 104384,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Vamos aprender a trabalhar com <strong>template literals</strong> do JavaScript, que facilitam a adição de variáveis e expressões dentro de strings.</p><p>Dê uma olhada abaixo em como os template literals alcançam o mesmo resultado que o método mais longo acima.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Helen McGuire&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Hello &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + fullName + \" /><text value=\"&quot;!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"`Hello \" /><text value=\"${fullName}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Hello Helen McGuire!\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Hello Helen McGuire!\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Literal string",
            "id": 104385,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os template literals facilitam a combinação de strings com variáveis através de literais de string.</p><p>Vamos transformar a string <code>\"Apple\"</code> em um string literal, colocando <code>Apple</code> entre caracteres de crase em vez de aspas duplas.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`</code> seguido de <code>Apple</code> e finalmente <code>`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Os template literals facilitam a combinação de strings com variáveis através de literais de string.</p><p>Vamos transformar a string <code>\"Apple\"</code> em um string literal, colocando <code>Apple</code> entre caracteres de crase em vez de aspas duplas.</p><p>Armazene <code>Apple</code> em um template literal para depois incluir uma expressão.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Apple&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Apple'\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"Cake\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>cake</code> e finalmente <code>Apple</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Variables",
            "id": 104386,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para combinar facilmente variáveis com literais de string, usamos a sintaxe <code>${name}</code> onde <code>name</code> é uma variável.</p><p>Código <code>${category}</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" category = \" /><text value=\"`pie`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple \" /><text value=\"${category}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple pie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>category</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Para combinar facilmente variáveis com literais de string, usamos a sintaxe <code>${name}</code> onde <code>name</code> é uma variável.</p><p>Código <code>${category}</code>.</p><p>Faça o console exibir <code>Apple pie</code> inserindo o valor de <code>category</code> depois de Apple.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" category = \" /><text value=\"`pie`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cake = \" /><text value=\"`Apple \" /><text value=\"${category}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cake);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"45\" /><option startIndex=\"45\" endIndex=\"46\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option startIndex=\"30\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"$[category]\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"${category}\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"`${category}`\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Apple pie\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>cake</code> seguido de <code>$</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>category</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Expressions",
            "id": 104387,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos realizar operações dentro de um literal de string adicionando expressões dentro das chaves de <code>${}</code>.</p><p>Adicione a expressão <code>quantity * price</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cost = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost : \" /><text value=\"${quantity * price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"84\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\",\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost : 200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>quantity</code> seguido de <code>*</code> e finalmente <code>price</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Também podemos realizar operações dentro de um literal de string adicionando expressões dentro das chaves de <code>${}</code>.</p><p>Adicione a expressão <code>quantity * price</code>.</p><p>Faça o template exibir <code>Total cost : 200</code> calculando quantidade vezes preço dentro dele.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" quantity = \" /><text value=\"20\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" price = \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" cost = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost : \" /><text value=\"${quantity * price}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(cost);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"68\" /><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"76\" /><option startIndex=\"77\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"84\" endIndex=\"85\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost : 200\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code>, <code>quantity</code>, <code>*</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Functions",
            "id": 104388,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao chamar uma função, omitimos os parênteses <code>()</code> se estivermos passando um literal de string como argumento para a função.</p><p>Vamos passar o literal de string <code>Jane</code> ao chamar a função <code>greetings</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Bonjour \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greetings\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(Jane)\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bonjour Jane!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`Jane`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ao chamar uma função, omitimos os parênteses <code>()</code> se estivermos passando um literal de string como argumento para a função.</p><p>Vamos passar o literal de string <code>Jane</code> ao chamar a função <code>greetings</code>.</p><p>Use a chamada de função tag que exibe <code>Bonjour Jane!</code> sem parênteses antes do template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" greetings = \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"name\" class=\"params\" /><text value=\") =&gt;\" /><text value=\" {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"return\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Bonjour \" /><text value=\"${name}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"!`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"};\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(greetings\" /><text value=\"`Jane`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"73\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"82\" endIndex=\"88\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"console\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"greetings(`Jane`)\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Jane&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Bonjour Jane!\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>greetings</code> seguido de <code>`Jane`</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Literal string",
            "id": 105017,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como transformamos uma string em um literal de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ao colocar a string entre caracteres de acento grave</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Colocando a string entre aspas duplas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ao colocar a string entre caracteres de acento grave.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você pretende inserir uma variável no texto depois. Quais delimitadores devem envolver o texto inicial?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Crases, para criar um template literal.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Aspas duplas, para criar um template literal.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Parênteses, para criar um template literal.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Crases, para criar um template literal.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Variables",
            "id": 105018,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que há de errado com o seguinte código que deveria exibir <code>June Jenny</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastName = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"`June $[lastName]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"June $[lastName]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Devemos usar chaves <code>{}</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Devemos usar parênteses <code>()</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Devemos usar chaves <code>{}</code> em vez de colchetes <code>[]</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>A saída contém <code>$[lastName]</code> em vez de Jenny. Qual edição avalia a variável armazenada?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" lastName = \" /><text value=\"`Jenny`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" fullName = \" /><text value=\"`June $[lastName]`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(fullName);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"June $[lastName]\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Substituir os colchetes por chaves.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Substituir os colchetes por parênteses.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Remover o cifrão.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Substituir os colchetes por chaves.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Expressions",
            "id": 105019,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como combinamos expressões com literais de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Adicionamos expressões dentro das chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Adicionamos expressões após as chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Adicionamos expressões dentro das chaves da sintaxe <code>${}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Em <code>`Total: ${price * quantity}`</code>, onde fica a multiplicação para o resultado aparecer no texto?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Dentro das chaves depois de <code>$</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Depois da chave de fechamento, fora do template.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Dentro de parênteses em vez de chaves.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Dentro das chaves depois de <code>$</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Functions",
            "id": 105020,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que deixamos de fora ao chamar uma função com um argumento literal de string?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O parêntese <code>()</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As crases</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O parêntese <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uma tag de template é seguida imediatamente por um template literal. Qual pontuação não aparece antes da crase?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Os parênteses.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As crases.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">O cifrão.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Os parênteses.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Literal string",
            "id": 105022,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Inclua o título do filme <code>Brave</code> como um literal de string.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movie = \" /><text value=\"`Brave`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(movie);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"´Brave´\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brave\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>`Brave`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Armazene <code>Brave</code> em uma constante chamada <code>movie</code> usando um template literal.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"movie\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"`Brave`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".\" /><text value=\"log\" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"movie\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\";\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"11\" /><option startIndex=\"14\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"let\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"film\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;Brave&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"'Brave'\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Brave\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>movie</code> e finalmente <code>`Brave`</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Variables",
            "id": 105023,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique o segundo literal de string para combinar os dois em um só.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" old = \" /><text value=\"`Superman`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" latest = \" /><text value=\"`Startrek`\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" movies = \" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\"${old}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"${latest}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(movies);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"69\" endIndex=\"78\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Superman, Startrek\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>${latest}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Expressions",
            "id": 105024,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escreva o código para calcular o custo total dos ingressos de cinema.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticketPrice = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" persons = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost: \" /><text value=\"${ticketPrice * persons}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost: 2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code> e depois <code>*</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Você pode avaliar expressões dentro de um template literal colocando-as entre <code>${</code> e <code>}</code>.</p><p>Faça o template exibir <code>Total cost: 2500</code> multiplicando nele o preço do ingresso pelo número de pessoas.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" ticketPrice = \" /><text value=\"500\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" persons = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" total = \" /><text value=\"`Total cost: \" /><text value=\"${ticketPrice * persons}\" class=\"subst\" /><text value=\"`\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(total);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"65\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option startIndex=\"66\" endIndex=\"67\" /><option startIndex=\"67\" endIndex=\"78\" /><option startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"88\" endIndex=\"89\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Total cost: 2500\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>$</code> seguido de <code>{</code>, <code>ticketPrice</code>, <code>*</code> e finalmente <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Functions",
            "id": 105025,
